    {
      "title": "How It Works",
      "content": "EUREKA works by taking the environment source code as context and using a large language model to generate executable reward functions. It then iteratively improves these rewards through <strong> evolutionary search </strong> and <strong> reward reflection </strong>. This process allows EUREKA to adapt to new tasks and environments without requiring task-specific prompts or human intervention.",
