    {
      "title": "The Results",
      "content": "EUREKA has been evaluated on a diverse suite of 29 open-source RL environments, including 10 distinct robot morphologies. The results show that EUREKA outperforms human experts in 83% of tasks, with an average normalized improvement of 52%. Additionally, EUREKA can generate novel rewards that are weakly correlated with human rewards, demonstrating its ability to discover new reward design principles.",
